{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "a738068fd79305bf53189c72369e342031ae31c93302aaf6f800f71b0db0838f", "ja": "ラッキーパンチ？　ナイスパンチ！", "zh": "侥幸击中？漂亮一拳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d10cb98b7c4eb2df62da798326731b011b5c528f2f666f18051d62460f4d6121", "ja": "公演の宣伝のため、テレビ番組に出演する事\nになったメンバー達。発言が少ない美也を心\n配するプロデューサーだったが、千鶴のフォ\nローで、美也は観客を引き込む見事な発言を\nしてみせる。本番への助走はバッチリ！", "zh": "为了宣传公演，成员们要参加电视节目。制作人担心美也发言太少，但在千鹤的帮助下，美也说出了成功吸引观众的精彩发言。为正式演出做的热身准备万无一失！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c7bfdc2974008bd300feb296d21f4ffeff33f633e85de02b2ae2919c50d3a65b", "ja": "（ライブの宣伝で、TV番組に出演する事になった。\nみんな、多くの人に情報と魅力を届けてくれ！）", "zh": "（为了宣传演唱会，大家要参加电视节目了。各位，把相关信息和魅力传达给更多人吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_07_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "5c8c0456e527e479217f006a50dbc956570944e94beaa0e7fece03b771cf44f9", "ja": "765プロで日本全国を巡ったミリオンシアター\nシーズン……でも、まだ一段落じゃありません！", "zh": "765艺能巡回全日本的MILLION THEATER\nSEASON……不过，这可还没告一段落呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_07_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "76f890d21ec0db7eb54ed982f7b3fbee97623e26d8f8a4cda6b41e2d4fd7e650", "ja": "関東各地を巡る、シーズン・ファイナルが、\nいよいよスタートいたしますわ！", "zh": "巡游关东各地的季终篇，终于要开始了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_07_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e99ee7fcfe330222c9d1f5f498c70021cfe8638b6db5a16938ab4be5953d2377", "ja": "みんなー！　絶対絶対、見に来てね！\nわたしと約束ですよっ♪", "zh": "大家——！一定要一定要来看哦！\n要和我约好了哟♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_07_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ccaad9c6ac20fc5adb1fac2a5ffcda30af05a4636626cb640d7d44b12577a0aa", "ja": "（いい感じだが、美也の発言が少なめかな……？\n誰かフォローしてくれるとありがたいが……）", "zh": "（气氛不错，不过美也说的话是不是有点少……？要是有人能帮忙接个话就好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_07_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "2872c78d1f87fd95cf31c333b3ac4e5e6a9bb08e59960ed4a008220e453103e2", "ja": "みなさん、気合い十分ですわね！\n……美也は、意気込みなどありませんの？", "zh": "大家都干劲十足呢！\n……美也，你没有什么干劲十足的宣言吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_07_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "cddd5c22e036f108ba2242908a451d175062cb2a3766796382fe42860704270a", "ja": "特にありません～。本番を見てくれれば、\n私たちの本気は、必ず伝わりますからね～。", "zh": "没什么特别的～只要来看正式演出，我们的认真一定能传达给大家的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_07_1007_audiences", "source_sha256": "2877439546d47290af27a04d5457d18976bc1583733cc5ade5f3dedd145d3830", "ja": "おお～……！", "zh": "哦哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_07_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "3023a50e18349321f03a5cd37e2fe3b7dd8a7e037898e960d21e5414abc15d52", "ja": "つまり、見てくれないと、伝わらないということで……\nみなさん、ぜひ会場に、足を運んでくださいね～。", "zh": "也就是说，如果不来看的话，就没法传达给大家……\n请大家一定要亲自来到现场哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_07_1009_null", "source_sha256": "4f10f377623d30a2f8e6eef9924c2cd8b7962dcbd80ad5f1e46aca35a570d7f4", "ja": "収録後……", "zh": "录音结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_07_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6e394d5752fcdaafa9f255143639baca255393944f293c4ca9159b66c77f9cbd", "ja": "美也の発言、ぐっと観客を引き込んでくれたな。\n最小の発言で最大の効果……ナイスだったよ！", "zh": "美也刚才的发言，一下子就把观众吸引住了。用最少的话达到最大的效果……干得漂亮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_07_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "1aacab30e933e683d67de9644ddf544c50eaf69eaed940a5ea6b9de569136137", "ja": "本当に……こっちまで驚いちゃったな。\nまさかあんなパンチを狙ってたなんてね……。", "zh": "真的……连我都吓了一跳。\n没想到你居然是冲着那样的 punch 去的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_07_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "8e2f860c37d6bbcb329533c8e8fc48e13e74817738a6a81009bbe543cc4450ed", "ja": "むふふ、好評のようでなによりですな～。\nでも、狙っていたというほどではありません～。", "zh": "嘻嘻，看来反响不错，真是太好了～  \n不过，也没到特意瞄准的程度啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_07_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "a85a71337fa0d1fc5b56b880f5b38582221a2a0674093f7fa1730f4ea83d145c", "ja": "やっぱり、ライブは見てもらってこそですから……\n私は、それを伝えようとしただけです～。", "zh": "毕竟，演出有人看才有意义呢……\n我只是想把这份心意传达出去而已～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_07_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8533dd97c8c43b61a31ac10e8fe50051eaeed1a0cd2213e38e7f85c15a166137", "ja": "うう……美也さんに比べたら、わたしなんて、\nただはしゃいでただけかも……ちょっとくやしい～。", "zh": "呜呜……跟美也姐比起来，我好像\n只是在瞎胡闹而已……有点不甘心～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_07_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "6f53e9705a56a0036050c39d382ff8b9c75e940d6d62700368de0cc115328394", "ja": "じゃあその気持ちは、レッスンにぶつけよう！　美也の\n言葉を本当にするには、全員の力が必要だからね。", "zh": "那就把这份心情倾注到训练中吧！要让美也的话成为现实，需要大家的力量才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_07_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "1c92361aabc48942290f1c26410dc274dc0d3dc008e8947e757290eed02b5e4e", "ja": "ええ。もとより、生半可なものをお見せするつもりは\nありませんもの。翼も同じでしょう？", "zh": "是的。我们本来就没打算拿半吊子的成果给大家看。翼也是这么想的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_07_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1a6f044250f68f938eb6cb6bbcd3451a2705015252828dc1b8d0c52e582d9314", "ja": "それは、もちろんです！　わたしたちで、\nすっごいライブにしちゃいますから！", "zh": "那当然了！我们会把这场演出办得超棒的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "9c3a8813fd733e1de2a90c7972e9325d677e482ce18e4ed1c8059b862584bce6", "ja": "（それぞれの個性が相乗効果を生んでいる……\n今回のライブは、おおいに期待できそうだ！）", "zh": "（每个人的个性都产生了相乘的效果……这次的演出很值得期待啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
